{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04269","headline":"边夜有怀 · 骆宾王","name":"边夜有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉地行逾远，燕山去不穷。\n城荒犹筑怨，碣毁尚铭功。\n古戍烟尘满，边庭人事空。\n夜关明陇月，秋塞急胡风。\n倚伏良难定，荣枯岂易通。\n旅魂劳泛梗，离恨断征蓬。\n苏武封犹薄，崔駰宦不工。\n惟余北叟意，欲寄南飞鸿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}